id: TRANS-006
ilities: [authenticity]
source: cpm
maturity: 2
action: block
title: SSH host key checking disabled (MITM risk)
category: transport
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .py .sh .yml .yaml .ts .js
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: StrictHostKeyChecking
patterns:
  - regex: StrictHostKeyChecking.*no|StrictHostKeyChecking=no
    message: "SSH host key checking disabled — enables MITM attacks"
fix: Use StrictHostKeyChecking=yes or StrictHostKeyChecking=accept-new. Disabling host key checking allows attackers to impersonate servers.
